    "created_at": "2015-10-30T05:04:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-30T05:04:20Z",
    "body": "It isn't interoperably implemented -- Blink and WebKit return `img` for `form.elements.foo` but Gecko/Edge/spec don't. The path to interop is either case that two engines change, but we have an opportunity to remove one piece of crazy here.\n",
