    "created_at": "2015-10-30T05:07:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-30T05:07:51Z",
    "body": "No, sorry, this change means everyone has to change, so the path to interop would be shorter by changing Blink and WebKit to match Gecko and Edge. But @bzbarsky was OK with the change, I think it's good to remove unnecessary crazy steps when it's shown to be safe and someone wants to do it.\n",
