    "updated_at": "2015-10-30T05:17:16Z",
    "body": "Note that there's some history for this in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=870787 complete with discussion about other browsers' behavior, etc.  It sounds at first glance like older IE used to not return images from `form.foo`, but Gecko and WebKit did, so that got specced...\n\nIn any case, if Blink wants to remove this and prove that's web-compatible, it would be nice to reduce complexity here a bit.\n",
