    "updated_at": "2015-10-30T11:22:06Z",
    "body": "In general I think we should be hesitant to fiddle with very old APIs if there's a faster path to interop, but usage is truly insignificant, with no registered hits most days, and including images really doesn't make sense, so I'm OK with trying this if everyone's on board.\n",
