    "body": "If non-descendant `img` can be removed from implementations, I believe the diff for the spec would be just\n\n``` diff\n@@ -23414,7 +23414,6 @@ was an English &lt;a href=\"/wiki/Music_hall\">music hall&lt;/a> singer, ...</pre>\n    <dd><span>Flow content</span>.</dd>\n    <dd><span>Phrasing content</span>.</dd>\n    <dd><span>Embedded content</span>.</dd>\n-   <dd><span>Form-associated element</span>.</dd>\n    <dd>If the element has a <code data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-usemap\">usemap</code> attribute: <span>Interactive content</span>.</dd>\n    <dd><span>Palpable content</span>.</dd>\n    <dt><span data-x=\"concept-element-contexts\">Contexts in which this element can be used</span>:</dt>\n@@ -42108,7 +42107,6 @@ the cell that corresponds to the values of the two dice.\n    <li><code>output</code></li>\n    <li><code>select</code></li>\n    <li><code>textarea</code></li>\n-   <li><code>img</code></li>\n   </ul>\n\n   <p>The <span data-x=\"form-associated element\">form-associated elements</span> fall into several\n@@ -114806,7 +114796,6 @@ if (s = prompt('What is your name?')) {\n       <code>output</code>;\n       <code>select</code>;\n       <code>textarea</code>;\n-      <code>img</code>\n      <td>\n       &mdash;\n```\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
